{"data":{"body":"[P3] `InMemorySpanExporter` receives only ended spans, making this assertion tautological; an abandoned Workflow or operation span is absent and still passes. The previous implementation therefore satisfies the non-export checks despite leaking recording spans. Install a test `SpanProcessor` that tracks `onStart`/`onEnd` and assert every started span ends\u2014or that deferred Workflow/operation spans never start\u2014on PENDING and RETRYING paths for both plugins.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7mh7tl","finding_digest":"f9012cda79d42c8abb63d2f529d628c4c21e7475c56a4eec6f9ad79a53781e3f","finding_id":"arf_v1_7easzwtz2qwivo3d2l2stvriyt","finding_key":"otel-plugin/executionotelplugintest::everyrecordingspanisended::started-spans-observable","identity_key":"otel-plugin/executionotelplugintest::everyrecordingspanisended::started-spans-observable","line":984,"observation_digest":"d9ed5a57ce74bc7f3924405d27a0feb9c69c41d0905c1b0ee3a22cb5f7bd02f7","observation_id":"aro_v1_3hwvuv6oos6h6ojeibospih6xh","path":"otel-plugin/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/ExecutionOtelPluginTest.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-08-27T00:03:16Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jdik6h3ycsz7w7wiwt3wpy56vi","reviewed_base_sha":"39d11d9532d22382048da49f3f56c053ceaf1320","reviewed_head_sha":"af20a3459574c5e7e4d0b1e5a0e220ff5cd6c842","reviewer":"codex","start_line":981,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":650},"record_id":"art_v1_6uq3ud6ohurymnnjvglmorzqnh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-27T00:03:16Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
